# Trivy ignore list — CVE IDs listed here do not fail the image scan.
#
# Policy: the gate fails on HIGH and CRITICAL vulnerabilities that HAVE a fix
# available (--ignore-unfixed). A CVE with no upstream fix cannot be resolved
# by this project, so blocking on it would block every build forever; those
# are still listed in reports/trivy.txt.
#
# Anything added here needs a reason, an owner, and an expiry date — Trivy
# honours `exp:` and starts failing again once it passes. Format:
#
#   # <why it does not apply> — <who> — <date>
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
